{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "So I have a strategy of how to find a job I am passionate about, and I need to make a timeline to help me set my goals. I give myself four months. After that, I will need to tighten my belt.  It never is easy when the money runs out, is it?\n<br/>\nIn my first month, I will have found my big problem that I am going to solve. I will have identified a field that I am interested in and I will have explored work opportunities in that area. It sounds like a daunting task, doesn't it? However, in order to find my dream job, I need to establish where my interests lie.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "In month two, I will have made a list of companies that are trying to solve my problem and hopefully, share my interests. I will have researched each company and combed their web pages for job listings.\n<br/>\nThen, in my third month, I will have searched my circle of friends to see who is connected to my target companies. It does sound silly, doesn't it?  Nonetheless, establishing contacts already in the company is a great way to discover more about the organization.", "id": 2, "time": "39200", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Finally in month four, I will have created a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 that is innovative and will capture people's attention. In the r\u00e9sum\u00e9,  I will have highlighted how my passion can help the company meet its aspirations.\n<br/>\nAll of this won't help, will it? I have to stay positive.<br/>\nI can do this, can't I?", "id": 3, "time": "72500", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le09ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le09ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "au